# Everything under .danxbot/ is danxbot CLIENT runtime state (per-connected-
# repo: worktrees, workspaces, inject trees, settings, secrets) EXCEPT the
# committed connected-repo declaration in config/ + scripts/. Ignore all,
# re-include those two. Broad-by-design so the inject pipeline can add new
# regenerable runtime dirs without a .gitignore edit (CP3 — service vs
# client layering).
*
!.gitignore
!config/
!config/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
boards/*/workspaces/*/.claude/rules/danx-*.md
boards/*/workspaces/*/.claude/hooks/worktree-guard.mjs
boards/*/workspaces/*/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
boards/*/workspaces/*/.claude/clad.json
boards/*/workspaces/board-chat/CLAUDE.md
boards/*/workspaces/board-chat/workspace.yml
boards/*/workspaces/board-chat/workspace-shape.test.ts
boards/*/workspaces/board-chat/mcp.template.json
boards/*/workspaces/board-chat/.claude/settings.json
boards/*/workspaces/board-chat/.claude/skills/danx-prep/
boards/*/workspaces/issue-chat/CLAUDE.md
boards/*/workspaces/issue-chat/workspace.yml
boards/*/workspaces/issue-chat/workspace-shape.test.ts
boards/*/workspaces/issue-chat/mcp.template.json
boards/*/workspaces/issue-chat/.claude/settings.json
boards/*/workspaces/issue-chat/.claude/skills/danx-prep/
